<title>USA: American Resources share hike approved.</title>
<headline>American Resources share hike approved.</headline>
<dateline>VERSAILLES, Ky. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Resources of Delaware Inc said Wednesday that shareholders at the annual meeting approved an increase in the number of its outstanding shares to 50 million from 20 million.</p>
<p>The company also said it bought a working interest in 23 gas wells in Whitley and Knox Counties, Ky., from Daugherty Petroleum Inc for about $526,000 in June.</p>
</text>
